WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.238
Each of these dangers is a review
that looks fine and quietly isn't.

2
00:00:04.238 --> 00:00:07.582
The worst ties back to Chapter
2: a setting that removes

3
00:00:07.582 --> 00:00:11.075
the emergency accounts the
first month nobody responds.

4
00:00:11.075 --> 00:00:15.075
Close behind are self-reviews,
reviews with nobody to step in,

5
00:00:15.075 --> 00:00:19.075
and denials that never take
effect because auto-apply is off.

6
00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:23.396
Some are traps of the API itself:
a scope that can't change in place,

7
00:00:23.396 --> 00:00:26.250
or a delete that takes
the evidence with it.

8
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.301
And one the code can't fix alone:

9
00:00:28.301 --> 00:00:32.710
a user denied an Azure role still
sits in the group that grants it.
